{"route":"/docs/5.3/content/images/","version":"5.3","renderedVersion":"5.3","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Images","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Documentation and examples for opting images into responsive behavior (so they never become wider than their parent) and add lightweight styles to them—all via classes."},"blocks":[{"id":"responsive-images","type":"heading","en":"Responsive images","level":2},{"id":"responsive-images--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Images in Bootstrap are made responsive with <code>.img-fluid</code>. This applies <code>max-width: 100%;</code> and <code>height: auto;</code> to the image so that it scales with the parent width."},{"id":"responsive-images--example-1","type":"demo","key":"e61a0395f3220377fad9","height":300},{"id":"responsive-images--code-1","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"img-fluid\" alt=\"...\">","language":"html"},{"id":"image-thumbnails","type":"heading","en":"Image thumbnails","level":2},{"id":"image-thumbnails--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"In addition to our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/borders\">border-radius utilities</a>, you can use <code>.img-thumbnail</code> to give an image a rounded 1px border appearance."},{"id":"image-thumbnails--example-1","type":"demo","key":"3049dabc6e47c5267627","height":147},{"id":"image-thumbnails--code-1","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"img-thumbnail\" alt=\"...\">","language":"html"},{"id":"aligning-images","type":"heading","en":"Aligning images","level":2},{"id":"aligning-images--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Align images with the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/float\">helper float classes</a> or <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/text#text-alignment\">text alignment classes</a>. <code>block</code>-level images can be centered using <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/utilities/spacing#horizontal-centering\">the <code>.mx-auto</code> margin utility class</a>."},{"id":"aligning-images--example-1","type":"demo","key":"d6af135d00b516fff198","height":174},{"id":"aligning-images--code-1","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded float-start\" alt=\"...\">\n<img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded float-end\" alt=\"...\">","language":"html"},{"id":"aligning-images--example-2","type":"demo","key":"9c5a1f3684bc0f0d51a6","height":147},{"id":"aligning-images--code-2","type":"code","value":"<img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded mx-auto d-block\" alt=\"...\">","language":"html"},{"id":"aligning-images--example-3","type":"demo","key":"a0df5ac71618ab52313f","height":147},{"id":"aligning-images--code-3","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"text-center\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"picture","type":"heading","en":"Picture","level":2},{"id":"picture--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"If you are using the <code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> element to specify multiple <code>&lt;source&gt;</code> elements for a specific <code>&lt;img&gt;</code>, make sure to add the <code>.img-*</code> classes to the <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> and not to the <code>&lt;picture&gt;</code> tag."},{"id":"picture--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Give the <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> an <code>alt</code> text that describes the image, or an empty <code>alt=&quot;&quot;</code> when it’s only decorative. The <code>alt=&quot;...&quot;</code> in the example below is a placeholder for that text."},{"id":"picture--code-1","type":"code","value":"<picture>\n  <source srcset=\"...\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"img-fluid img-thumbnail\" alt=\"...\">\n</picture>","language":"html"},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"sass-variables","type":"heading","en":"Sass variables","level":3},{"id":"sass-variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Variables are available for image thumbnails."},{"id":"sass-variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"$thumbnail-padding:                 .25rem;\n$thumbnail-bg:                      var(--#{$prefix}body-bg);\n$thumbnail-border-width:            var(--#{$prefix}border-width);\n$thumbnail-border-color:            var(--#{$prefix}border-color);\n$thumbnail-border-radius:           var(--#{$prefix}border-radius);\n$thumbnail-box-shadow:              var(--#{$prefix}box-shadow-sm);","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"e61a0395f3220377fad9","html":" <svg aria-label=\"Placeholder: Responsive image\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img bd-placeholder-img-lg img-fluid\" height=\"250\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">Responsive image</text></svg> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"3049dabc6e47c5267627","html":" <svg aria-label=\"A generic square placeholder image with a white border around it, making it resemble a photograph taken with an old instant camera: 200x200\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img img-thumbnail\" height=\"200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" width=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>A generic square placeholder image with a white border around it, making it resemble a photograph taken with an old instant camera</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">200x200</text></svg> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"d6af135d00b516fff198","html":" <svg aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded float-start\" height=\"200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" width=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">200x200</text></svg>\n<svg aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded float-end\" height=\"200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" width=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">200x200</text></svg> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"9c5a1f3684bc0f0d51a6","html":" <svg aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded mx-auto d-block\" height=\"200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" width=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">200x200</text></svg> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"a0df5ac71618ab52313f","html":" <div class=\"text-center\">\n  <svg aria-label=\"Placeholder: 200x200\" class=\"bd-placeholder-img rounded\" height=\"200\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" width=\"200\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#868e96\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">200x200</text></svg>\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/introduction"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/download"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/contents"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/browsers-devices"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/javascript"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/webpack"},{